[I] Fast and lightweight x86/x86-64 disassembler and code generation library

[T] Zydis is a fast and lightweight x86/x86-64 disassembler and code
[T] generation library supporting all instructions and extensions. It is
[T] optimized for performance, does no dynamic memory allocation, is
[T] thread-safe by design and has a small footprint.

[U] https://github.com/zyantific/zydis

[A] Joel Höner <joel@zyantific.com>
